1
00:00:01,820 --> 00:00:03,400
基本准备好了
Okay. We're almost ready here.

2
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:05,120
好 滤镜别用得太过 小卡
Okay. Now, easy on the filters, Cam.

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,060
全家福而已 不要用什么复古色调
It's a family picture. We don't need sepia tone.

4
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,480
你知道什么色调[语调]不该用吗
You know what other tone we don't need?

5
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:09,360
友好一点
Play nice.

6
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:10,500
好吧
Okay.

7
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:12,920
我们要拍张新照片挂在壁炉上
We are taking a new photo for above our mantel.

8
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:14,900
现在挂的那张没有莉莉
Lily's not in the one up there now,

9
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:18,120
我们察觉到...这似乎让她有点...
and we...started to get the slight impression that...

10
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:19,600
不满意
it was bothering her.

11
00:00:20,347 --> 00:00:22,733
莉莉 要吃晚饭啦 亲...
Lily, we're ready for dinner, sw--

12
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:28,900
笑得灿烂一点
Big smiles!

13
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:31,460
-太好了 -太好了
- Great. - Great.

14
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:33,140
来看看
Let's take a look.

15
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:37,240
还不错
Okay. Not bad.

16
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:37,960
还不错
Not bad.

17
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:41,400
-我们来抖下脸 -真的要吗
- Let's shake out our faces. - Really?

18
00:00:41,409 --> 00:00:43,536
是谁在网上看了教学视频 快抖抖
Who took the online course? Shake 'em out.

19
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:46,180
可以了 非常好
Yep. That's perfect.

20
00:00:49,649 --> 00:00:51,849
-茄...子... -茄...子...
- Chee-e-e-se! - Chee-e-e-se!

21
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:53,300
好了 很好
Okay. Great!

22
00:00:55,465 --> 00:00:56,809
米奇尔
Okay, um, Mitchell,

23
00:00:56,821 --> 00:00:58,518
-你能过来一下吗 -好
- can I see you over here, please? - Yeah.

24
00:00:58,940 --> 00:00:59,560
等一下 亲爱的
Hang tight, sweetie.

25
00:01:00,380 --> 00:01:00,700
你看
Look.

26
00:01:01,770 --> 00:01:03,427
她的脸怎么那样
Why is she doing that with her face?

27
00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:04,300
不知道 我从没见过
I don't know. I've never seen

28
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:06,000
这么怪异又勉强的笑脸
such a weird, forced smile.

29
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:07,280
我好看吗
How do I look?

30
00:01:07,290 --> 00:01:09,013
-美死了 -好看极了
- Beautiful. - Perfect.

31
00:01:23,180 --> 00:01:24,880
这校园太棒了
What an amazing campus!

32
00:01:24,880 --> 00:01:26,440
看那些楼都超酷的
I mean, look at these cool buildings.

33
00:01:26,440 --> 00:01:28,274
你们有看到乌龟吗
And did you guys see the turtles?

34
00:01:28,274 --> 00:01:29,960
再看看这个
And check this out --

35
00:01:29,960 --> 00:01:31,040
明镜般的池塘
A reflecting pond.

36
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:33,320
很好 你可以照照看你现在有多疯癫了
Great. Maybe you can see how crazy you're being right now.

37
00:01:33,340 --> 00:01:34,840
天哪 我要是带飞盘来就好了
God, I wish I'd brought a frisbee.

38
00:01:35,480 --> 00:01:36,540
这里有什么特别的吗
What's so special?

39
00:01:36,820 --> 00:01:38,560
跟我之前上的大学一模一样啊
It looks exactly like the college I went to.

40
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:39,620
我们在这里的时间
And we've been here

41
00:01:39,620 --> 00:01:41,260
也跟你在那里待的时间一样短
exactly as long as you were there.

42
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:42,160
卢克 别这么刻薄
Luke, be nice.

43
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,300
艾丽克斯要走了
Well, Alex is leaving.

44
00:01:43,300 --> 00:01:45,280
总得有人继续毒舌传统吧
Somebody's got to keep the trains running.

45
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,360
支持我啊 各位
Back me up here, guys.

46
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:48,740
这地方太适合艾丽克斯了 对吧
This place screams "Alex," Right?

47
00:01:48,780 --> 00:01:50,900
跟美国其他大学没什么区别啊
It looks like every other college in America.

48
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:51,940
有什么我没注意到的吗
What am I missing?

49
00:01:52,068 --> 00:01:56,000
好成绩 SAT分数 基本语言能力
Good grades, S.A.T. scores, basic verbal skills.

50
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:56,740
学着点
That's how you do it.

51
00:01:58,260 --> 00:01:59,920
加州理工学院真是棒极了
Caltech is the perfect school.

52
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:00,760
对克莱尔来说
For Claire.

53
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,760
还有艾丽克斯 拜托 我们说的可是
And Alex! Come on, we are talking about

54
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:04,380
全国最好的学校之一
one of the best schools in the country.

55
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:06,820
是的 离我们家是只有45分钟车程
And, yes, it happens to be 45 minutes from our house.

56
00:02:06,900 --> 00:02:08,860
当然 她去哪儿我们都会支持她
Of course, we'll support her wherever she goes.

57
00:02:09,340 --> 00:02:11,740
当然啦 对我来说 没什么
Obviously. Nothing is more important to me

58
00:02:11,740 --> 00:02:12,960
比她的学业更重要
than her academic whatever,

59
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:13,720
但对于艾丽克斯
but with Alex,

60
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:15,720
最重要的是接下来四年
the important thing is keeping her close

61
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:16,780
要把她留在身边
for the next four years.

62
00:02:17,180 --> 00:02:19,280
之后她要是去了海王星
After that, I'm never gonna see her

63
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:21,900
住在她建的生态馆里
unless she Skypes me from Neptune,

64
00:02:21,900 --> 00:02:24,100
除非打视频电话 否则再也见不到她了
where she's living in a biodome she invented.

65
00:02:24,340 --> 00:02:26,100
太棒了 那就可以去海王星过圣诞了
Awesome! That means Christmas on Neptune!

66
00:02:28,700 --> 00:02:29,620
两年去一次好吗
Every other year?

67
00:02:30,020 --> 00:02:30,600
不 不
No. No.

68
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:33,540
各位 请聚拢过来
All right, everyone, gather 'round.

69
00:02:33,540 --> 00:02:35,140
我们马上要开始参观校园了
We'll be starting the tour in just a moment.

70
00:02:35,440 --> 00:02:37,880
我要自己逛 去机器人实验室
Okay. I'm gonna peel off and hit the robotics lab

71
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:39,540
看看它们跟职业女性有多像
to see how close they are to a working female.

72
00:02:39,660 --> 00:02:40,560
等等
Hold on.

73
00:02:41,160 --> 00:02:42,920
没你想象的那么像
They're not nearly as close as you'd hope,

74
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:44,380
你不准离开我
and you're not leaving my side.

75
00:02:44,460 --> 00:02:45,560
但很无聊啊
But it's so boring.

76
00:02:45,700 --> 00:02:46,900
感觉像是在受罚
It's like I'm being punished.

77
00:02:46,980 --> 00:02:47,920
你就是在受罚
You are being punished.

78
00:02:47,920 --> 00:02:49,360
你老师告诉我你逃课
That's what happens when your teacher calls

79
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:50,660
你就得受罚
to tell me you cut class.

80
00:02:51,020 --> 00:02:53,320
我很遗憾 我拍电影忘了时间
I'm sorry. I lost track of time making my movie.

81
00:02:53,320 --> 00:02:54,780
《蜂鸟人》
Hummingbirdman --

82
00:02:54,780 --> 00:02:57,800
一个每分钟心跳一千下的超级英雄
A superhero whose heart can beat a thousand times a minute.

83
00:02:58,680 --> 00:02:59,680
但他有感情吗
But can it love?

84
00:03:00,620 --> 00:03:02,440
你们看 学校里有个实验室
Check it -- there's a lab on campus

85
00:03:02,440 --> 00:03:04,320
拿你做实验还给你50块钱
where they do experiments on you for 50 bucks.

86
00:03:04,420 --> 00:03:06,840
对对对 我以前在学校里经常做这个
Oh, yeah. Yeah, I used to do a lot of these in college.

87
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:08,160
有时候是回答问题
Sometimes it's questions.

88
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,800
有时候往你身上插一堆装置
Sometimes they hook stuff up to you.

89
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:12,000
有时候是跟一只猴子一起玩耍
Sometimes it's just palling around with a monkey,

90
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,720
不知道为什么他们只奖励猴子不奖励我
wondering why they're rewarding him and not you.

91
00:03:14,020 --> 00:03:16,140
听起来不错 你应该试试
Well, that sounds great. You should go do that.

92
00:03:16,140 --> 00:03:16,760
我要去
I'll go.

93
00:03:16,980 --> 00:03:18,620
只要不用剃毛什么的 我就参加
I'm up for it as long as they don't shave anything.

94
00:03:18,620 --> 00:03:20,440
我很想赚这50块钱
Hey, I'd love the 50 bucks,

95
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:22,220
但我相信老妈希望我留下来
but I'm pretty sure mom wants me here.

96
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:23,420
没有 你可以去啊
No, I don't. You can go.

97
00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:25,160
别装了
Oh, you can drop the act.

98
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:26,900
我知道你俩逼我来这里
I know you guys forced me to come here

99
00:03:26,900 --> 00:03:27,860
就是要我学学艾丽克斯
so I can watch Alex

100
00:03:27,860 --> 00:03:29,900
重新激发我上大学的梦想
and get all inspired by college again.

101
00:03:30,040 --> 00:03:30,680
真的没有
We really didn't.

102
00:03:30,900 --> 00:03:32,220
对啊 是你自己上车的
Yeah, you just got in the car.

103
00:03:32,300 --> 00:03:33,520
我只准备了四份三明治
I only packed four sandwiches.

104
00:03:40,320 --> 00:03:41,420
结婚纪念日快乐 杰
Happy anniversary, Jay!

105
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,920
我不喜欢你这样
I don't love this tableau.

106
00:03:44,920 --> 00:03:46,560
这是歌洛莉亚给我的礼物吗
Is that Gloria's gift to me?

107
00:03:46,980 --> 00:03:47,660
是什么
What is it?

108
00:03:47,760 --> 00:03:48,300
不知道
I don't know.

109
00:03:48,460 --> 00:03:49,940
你肯定知道 一看就知道礼物是谁包的
Sure you do. I can tell by the wrap job.

110
00:03:50,260 --> 00:03:52,200
她折不出这样的角 曼尼
She can't make corners like this, Manny!

111
00:03:52,340 --> 00:03:54,060
那只是因为她总是匆匆忙忙的
Only because she's always in such a hurry.

112
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:56,480
生活真有这么忙碌吗 连抽出20分钟
Is life so busy you can't take 20 minutes

113
00:03:56,480 --> 00:03:58,640
找一把直尺好好包装礼物的时间都没有吗
to get out the straight-edge and wrap a gift anymore?

114
00:03:58,680 --> 00:04:00,740
别这样 我对我给她的礼物不太有信心
Come on. I'm a little anxious about my gift for her.

115
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:02,420
如果能知道这礼物是
It would make me feel a lot better

116
00:04:02,420 --> 00:04:04,020
电话购物来的我会不那么紧张
if I knew she phoned this one in.

117
00:04:04,160 --> 00:04:06,320
抱歉 杰 只有时间会告诉你答案
Sorry, Jay. Only time will tell.

118
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:07,080
天哪
Oh, God.

119
00:04:07,100 --> 00:04:09,900
是我一直想要的沛纳海手表是不是
It's that black Panerai watch I wanted, isn't it?!

120
00:04:09,940 --> 00:04:12,040
跟我猜字谜时 你反应怎么就没这么快
Why can't you be this fast when I'm your charades partner?

121
00:04:14,619 --> 00:04:16,200
好啊 亲爱的们
Hola, my loves!

122
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:17,720
假装没看到我 别让她进车库
You didn't see me. Keep her out of the garage.

123
00:04:20,520 --> 00:04:21,460
我们要怎么办
What are we gonna do?

124
00:04:21,580 --> 00:04:22,700
我去跟她谈谈
I'm gonna talk to her.

125
00:04:22,900 --> 00:04:24,560
我给她拍了这么多年照片
I've been photographing her for years.

126
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:25,820
我们之间建立了关系
We have a relationship.

127
00:04:25,900 --> 00:04:26,900
真的吗 对方人怎么样
Really? What's she like?

128
00:04:27,060 --> 00:04:28,660
我是说职业关系
I mean a professional relationship.

129
00:04:28,760 --> 00:04:29,800
我要告诉她
Look, I'm gonna tell her --

130
00:04:29,860 --> 00:04:32,120
她的笑是挤出来的 看起来不自然
Her smile is forced, it's unnatural,

131
00:04:32,300 --> 00:04:34,640
我们没拍出好看的照片 就绝不回家
and we're not going home until we get what we need.

132
00:04:34,860 --> 00:04:35,540
我要吐槽两点
Couple of things --

133
00:04:35,540 --> 00:04:37,240
首先我们在家 其次那很毒舌
we are home, and that's mean.

134
00:04:37,340 --> 00:04:38,340
你有什么建议
What's your suggestion?

135
00:04:38,540 --> 00:04:39,660
我们给她看照片
We show her the photos

136
00:04:39,660 --> 00:04:42,220
让她自己发现她诡异的笑容
and let her discover her weird smile on her own.

137
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:43,100
好吧 好主意
Okay. That's good.

138
00:04:43,100 --> 00:04:44,700
就像我录下了我们的橄榄球赛
I video our football games

139
00:04:44,700 --> 00:04:46,120
好让我看出哪里做错了
so I can see what we're doing wrong.

140
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:47,220
我就是那样发现
That's how I figured out

141
00:04:47,220 --> 00:04:49,260
粉蓝色风衣让我看起来没精神的
that powder-blue windbreaker washed me out so much.

142
00:04:49,460 --> 00:04:51,480
谢天谢地 橄榄球队一定很庆幸吧
Oh, thank god. I'm sure the team appreciated that.

143
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:53,420
-莉莉亲爱的 你能过来一下 -好
- Lily, sweetheart, will you come here for a second? - Yep.

144
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:55,280
我们温柔点 好吗
Let's do this gently, okay?

145
00:04:56,020 --> 00:04:56,820
亲爱的
Hi, sweetheart.

146
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:59,040
好了 大爸和我觉得
Okay. So, daddy and I thought

147
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:00,920
我们要一起看看这些
that we would look at these photos together,

148
00:05:00,980 --> 00:05:02,560
到目前为止我们拍摄的照片
the pictures that we've taken so far,

149
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:05,540
看看我们能不能做出什么改变
and see if there's anything that we would do differently.

150
00:05:05,620 --> 00:05:07,460
比如说 当我看到这张照片时
Like, okay, when I look at this photo,

151
00:05:07,460 --> 00:05:09,860
我觉得 我可以站得更直一点
I think, "I could stand up straighter."

152
00:05:09,860 --> 00:05:11,060
-是啊 -小卡你呢
- Yeah. - Cam?

153
00:05:11,060 --> 00:05:13,040
好 我觉得我不该帅得
Okay. I think I could be

154
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:14,560
像演员瑞恩·高斯林一样
a little less "Ryan Gosling"

155
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:16,005
应该表现得普通一点
and a little more "Every man."

156
00:05:17,980 --> 00:05:20,360
莉莉 你看见什么
Lily, is there anything that you see in yourself

157
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,700
想改变的地方了吗
that you would want to change here?

158
00:05:21,980 --> 00:05:24,140
也许我们该再拍一张
Well, maybe we should just do one more?

159
00:05:24,280 --> 00:05:25,380
真的吗 好
Really? Okay.

160
00:05:25,640 --> 00:05:27,940
这张脸要补点粉
This might need a little powder.

161
00:05:31,103 --> 00:05:32,238
杰
Uh, Jay?

162
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:33,800
你老婆在楼上
Your wife's upstairs.

163
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:35,240
你没必要再躲在车库里了
You don't have to hide in the garage anymore.

164
00:05:35,320 --> 00:05:36,020
我不是在躲着
I'm not hiding.

165
00:05:36,580 --> 00:05:37,520
关上门好吗
Close the door, will you?

166
00:05:38,740 --> 00:05:40,100
你给她买的礼物有多糟糕啊
How bad is the gift you bought her?

167
00:05:40,180 --> 00:05:41,200
我没给她买东西
I didn't buy her anything.

168
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:42,260
那真的太糟了
Bad idea.

169
00:05:42,440 --> 00:05:43,900
有次我给了她一袋拥抱
I once gave her a bag full of hugs,

170
00:05:43,900 --> 00:05:45,460
她明显更喜欢实物
and she definitely prefers stuff.

171
00:05:45,540 --> 00:05:46,360
不是拥抱
It's not hugs.

172
00:05:46,540 --> 00:05:47,520
那听起来像是我的风格吗
Does that sound like me?

173
00:05:48,380 --> 00:05:50,180
我在陶艺课上给她做了点东西
I made her something in my pottery class.

174
00:05:50,420 --> 00:05:52,000
你居然去上陶艺课
I can't believe you took a pottery class.

175
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:54,240
这家里不止你有艺术气质
You're not the only one around here with an artsy side.

176
00:05:54,240 --> 00:05:56,500
我可以给她买件首饰
Yeah, I could've bought her another piece of jewelry,

177
00:05:56,500 --> 00:05:59,240
但我想着 她也许更喜欢这个
but I thought, you know, she might like this a little more,

178
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,760
这是我倾注了心血的礼物
coming from the heart and all.

179
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:02,640
给我看看 是什么
Well, show it to me. What is it?

180
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:11,220
这是什么
What is it?

181
00:06:11,340 --> 00:06:11,860
是只小兔子
It's a bunny.

182
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:14,300
我以前叫她兔兔
It used to be my nickname for her.

183
00:06:14,300 --> 00:06:15,740
我们第一次约会时 她感冒了
On our first date, she had a cold,

184
00:06:15,740 --> 00:06:16,980
经常吸鼻子
and she was sniffling a lot,

185
00:06:16,980 --> 00:06:18,980
她的鼻子会很可爱地皱起来
and her nose would wrinkle up real cute --

186
00:06:18,980 --> 00:06:19,680
就像小兔子一样
you know, like a bunny.

187
00:06:19,860 --> 00:06:20,820
太有爱了
That's so sweet.

188
00:06:20,940 --> 00:06:23,160
是啊 但那块表又大又华丽
Yeah, but that watch is big and gorgeous

189
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:24,460
而且死贵的
and costs big bucks.

190
00:06:24,460 --> 00:06:27,181
我不能送她自制的东西 她...
I can't give her something handmade. I mean, she --

191
00:06:27,320 --> 00:06:29,180
她不像你我这么感情细腻
She's not sensitive like you and me.

192
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,280
听我说
Listen to me.

193
00:06:30,660 --> 00:06:33,260
我觉得你去了心灵的珠宝店
I think you went to the jewelry store inside here,

194
00:06:33,260 --> 00:06:34,800
带回来了一块宝石
and you brought back a gem.

195
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:35,560
闭嘴
Knock it off.

196
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:37,460
你这么觉得吗
You think so?

197
00:06:37,460 --> 00:06:38,815
她会喜欢的 这太完美了
She's gonna love it. It's perfect.

198
00:06:38,815 --> 00:06:39,780
不算完美啦
Perfect? Nah.

199
00:06:39,780 --> 00:06:42,360
但是帕布罗老师的确说我很有潜力
But teacher Pablo did say it shows great promise.

200
00:06:42,380 --> 00:06:44,240
尾巴是最让我自豪的部分
And I am proud of the tail.

201
00:06:44,300 --> 00:06:44,780
看看
Look at that.

202
00:06:44,935 --> 00:06:46,800
不不 我说的是看
No, no, I said look.

203
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:47,360
对不起
Sorry.

204
00:06:48,620 --> 00:06:52,200
这栋楼里住着本校的五位诺贝尔奖获得者
And this building is home to one of our five Nobel laureates

205
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:53,460
现在他们仍在这里教书
currently teaching here.

206
00:06:53,780 --> 00:06:56,780
里面还有高电流
It also houses our high-current,

207
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:58,760
高稳定性的粒子加速器
high-stability particle accelerator.

208
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:01,900
行了 你得冷静点
Okay. You need to calm down.

209
00:07:02,020 --> 00:07:03,260
这是参观校园
This is a college tour,

210
00:07:03,320 --> 00:07:04,380
不是在演《奥普拉的最爱》
not Oprah's Favorite Things.

211
00:07:04,460 --> 00:07:07,460
我只是被这学校震撼到了 你没有吗
I am just so impressed by this place. Aren't you?

212
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:08,260
当然啦
Of course I am.

213
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:10,460
这是全国最著名的科技院校之一
It's one of the most prestigious tech schools in the country.

214
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:12,200
但如果你非得知道
But if you must know,

215
00:07:12,200 --> 00:07:13,720
我并不爱这所校园的一切
I don't love everything about it.

216
00:07:14,420 --> 00:07:16,460
是什么 对了 吉祥物是海狸
What? Oh, the mascot's a beaver.

217
00:07:16,740 --> 00:07:17,960
别担心 那些笑话会过时的
Don't worry. Those jokes will get old.

218
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:19,740
不会的 因为我不会来这里
No, they won't, because I'm not coming here.

219
00:07:20,140 --> 00:07:22,120
说真的 我今天来参观的唯一原因就是
Honestly, the only reason I took this tour today

220
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:23,720
好让你别说我没有给这学校
is so you won't accuse me of

221
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:24,700
一个公平的机会
not giving it a fair shot.

222
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,620
你为什么不想来这里
Why wouldn't you want to go here?

223
00:07:27,100 --> 00:07:28,740
难以置信你要逼我说出来
I can't believe you're making me say this...

224
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:30,260
这里离家太近了
It's too close to home.

225
00:07:30,500 --> 00:07:32,580
我得离你们远点 好吗
I have to get away from you guys for a little bit, okay?

226
00:07:35,620 --> 00:07:38,200
好了 我们去看看宿舍
All right. We're gonna check out the dorms.

227
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:40,160
父母们 跟孩子们道别吧
Parents, say goodbye to your children.

228
00:07:41,434 --> 00:07:42,000
好
Okay.

229
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:42,920
我该走了
I should go.

230
00:07:47,740 --> 00:07:48,560
妈妈 等等
Mom, wait!

231
00:07:48,700 --> 00:07:49,520
亲爱的 没关系
Honey, it's okay.

232
00:07:49,520 --> 00:07:51,500
我们有时候就是会心口不一
We all say things that we don't mean sometimes.

233
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:52,880
低血糖 我要三明治
Low blood sugar. I need my sandwich.

234
00:07:53,640 --> 00:07:54,120
好
Yeah.

235
00:07:54,940 --> 00:07:55,320
好
Yeah.

236
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:04,200
好了 请你们在这里等着
All right. You can please wait here,

237
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:05,760
实验稍后开始
and the experiment will begin shortly.

238
00:08:05,820 --> 00:08:08,200
-好 谢谢 -不用
- Okay. Thank you. - Yeah.

239
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:14,640
你们觉得会是什么实验
What do you guys think this is gonna be?

240
00:08:14,640 --> 00:08:16,540
我敢打赌他们会给我们看
I bet they'll show us those ink blots

241
00:08:16,540 --> 00:08:18,120
像是两个女孩在接吻的墨迹
that always look like two girls kissing.

242
00:08:18,540 --> 00:08:19,700
老鸟给你点建议
A little tip from an old pro --

243
00:08:19,700 --> 00:08:21,740
他们可以给奶酪通电 所以...
They can electrify cheese, so...

244
00:08:22,340 --> 00:08:23,560
瞧瞧那个
Hey, look at that.

245
00:08:23,740 --> 00:08:24,600
别按
"Do not push."

246
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:26,340
你在干什么
What are you doing?

247
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:28,320
教教这按钮什么叫自由意志
Teaching this button a little something about free will.

248
00:08:28,420 --> 00:08:30,060
卢克 上面写着"别按"
Luke, it says, "Do not push."

249
00:08:30,060 --> 00:08:31,820
这让我更想按了
Which just makes me want to push it more.

250
00:08:32,380 --> 00:08:33,140
海莉 帮我说句话
Haley, back me up.

251
00:08:33,300 --> 00:08:34,940
按不按我都无所谓
Push it, don't push it. I don't care.

252
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:36,680
这镜子是不是有点怪 我看起来很模糊
Is this mirror weird? I look fuzzy.

253
00:08:38,340 --> 00:08:39,400
谁会安一个按钮
Who puts up a button

254
00:08:39,400 --> 00:08:41,000
然后贴个写着别按的标志啊
with a sign that says you can't push it?

255
00:08:41,100 --> 00:08:43,420
正是那些暗中布局
The same people who stack the deck

256
00:08:43,420 --> 00:08:45,620
好让猴子每次都赢的人
so the monkey always wins...

257
00:08:46,820 --> 00:08:47,220
科学家们
Scientists!

258
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,420
你在说什么
What are you talking about?

259
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:49,880
我们不是在等着做实验
We're not waiting for the experiment.

260
00:08:49,980 --> 00:08:50,960
这就是实验
This is the experiment!

261
00:08:51,020 --> 00:08:52,220
他们正看着我们呢
They're watching us right now!

262
00:08:52,760 --> 00:08:53,560
等等 你说什么
Wait. What?

263
00:08:58,100 --> 00:08:58,500
准备
And...

264
00:08:59,571 --> 00:09:01,220
-好了 -我们来看看吧
- Okay. Good. - All right. Let's take a look.

265
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:03,520
真漂亮
Oh! Beautiful.

266
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,700
她看起来就像胡娇家的小博美
Okay. She looks like Pepper's pomeranian.

267
00:09:05,700 --> 00:09:06,680
我们得说说她
We have to say something.

268
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:09,280
发生什么事了 怎么还没拍完啊
What's going on? Why are we still doing this?

269
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:13,980
宝贝 二爸和我觉得你是个漂亮的女孩
Honey, daddy and I think you are a beautiful girl

270
00:09:14,420 --> 00:09:15,560
笑起来特别好看
with a beautiful smile.

271
00:09:15,740 --> 00:09:16,540
谢谢
Thank you.

272
00:09:16,620 --> 00:09:17,100
不用谢
You're welcome.

273
00:09:17,340 --> 00:09:19,840
你现在就是这么好看
And I'm seeing that here, okay?

274
00:09:19,860 --> 00:09:22,560
可是在照片上却没看出来
But I'm just not seeing it here.

275
00:09:22,660 --> 00:09:23,640
你什么意思
What do you mean?

276
00:09:23,640 --> 00:09:26,194
是这样的
Uh, well, uh...

277
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:28,740
莉莉 你今天笑起来不太自然
Lily, you're doing a different smile today.

278
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:29,580
怎么不自然了
Different how?

279
00:09:29,780 --> 00:09:32,720
稍微有一点 僵硬
It's just a little... stiff.

280
00:09:33,480 --> 00:09:34,180
很丑吗
Is it ugly?

281
00:09:34,380 --> 00:09:35,820
一点也不丑
It's not ugly. No.

282
00:09:35,820 --> 00:09:37,792
只是 只是
It's, uh -- it, um...

283
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:38,600
小卡
Cam...

284
00:09:39,632 --> 00:09:41,780
是这样的 小宝贝
Uh, well, s-sweetie, um,

285
00:09:41,780 --> 00:09:45,040
看起来跟你平常美美的笑容有点不同
it's just not your normal smile, which is so beautiful.

286
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:46,580
你是说我不美吗
You mean I'm not beautiful?

287
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:48,380
不 我们不是这个意思
No, that's not what we're saying.

288
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:51,420
算了吧 我不想再拍了
Just forget it! I don't want to do this anymore!

289
00:09:51,660 --> 00:09:52,660
我是个丑八怪
I'm an ugly monster,

290
00:09:52,660 --> 00:09:54,540
我要关在房间里永远不出门
and I'm never coming out of my room again!

291
00:09:56,020 --> 00:09:58,200
好吧 我们搞砸了
Okay. Well, that was a disaster.

292
00:09:58,360 --> 00:09:59,340
的确 可是我得说
Agreed. But can I just say

293
00:09:59,340 --> 00:10:00,880
我好爱她那种超具戏剧性的气质
I love how melodramatic she's getting?

294
00:10:01,040 --> 00:10:02,800
非常棒
So fantastic.

295
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:04,397
-那种贵妃范儿 -我同意
- The little... - I know.

296
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:06,440
你在这
There she is.

297
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:10,540
亲爱的 结婚纪念日快乐
Hi, mi amor. Happy anniversary!

298
00:10:10,540 --> 00:10:11,900
你也是 亲爱的
Happy anniversary, honey.

299
00:10:11,900 --> 00:10:13,700
我希望你喜欢这个
I hope you like this.

300
00:10:13,700 --> 00:10:15,600
你给我买了什么
What did you get me?

301
00:10:18,080 --> 00:10:19,800
你给我买的这是什么啊
What did you get me?

302
00:10:20,060 --> 00:10:21,200
老妈 那是个兔子
It's a bunny, mom.

303
00:10:21,260 --> 00:10:22,640
边缘不是很光滑
It's a little rough around the edges,

304
00:10:22,640 --> 00:10:24,620
但我希望你会喜欢我放在里面的东西
but I'm just hoping you'll love what I put into it.

305
00:10:24,620 --> 00:10:26,356
你在里面放了东西啊
Oh, you put something inside?!

306
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:31,580
我不明白 这里面什么也没有
I don't get it. There's nothing inside.

307
00:10:31,580 --> 00:10:34,383
那 那是因为
Yeah, that's, uh... 'cause, um...

308
00:10:34,580 --> 00:10:37,780
那个白痴的珠宝商没把手链放进去
The damn stupid jeweler didn't put the bracelet in there.

309
00:10:38,880 --> 00:10:42,180
是我超爱的那个玫瑰金带波纹的手链吗
The rose gold with the waves that I told you that I loved?

310
00:10:42,180 --> 00:10:43,260
对 就是那个
Yeah. Yeah, that's the one.

311
00:10:43,260 --> 00:10:43,540
杰
Jay.

312
00:10:43,840 --> 00:10:44,620
没事的 曼尼
No, it's fine, Manny.

313
00:10:44,620 --> 00:10:46,540
我现在就去那间店把它拿回来
I can run down to the store right now and get it.

314
00:10:46,540 --> 00:10:47,140
白痴珠宝商
Stupid jeweler!

315
00:10:47,340 --> 00:10:48,900
杰 别骂他
Ay, Jay, don't scream at him.

316
00:10:48,940 --> 00:10:50,440
我相信这只是个无心之过
It was an honest mistake.

317
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:51,260
也许他心里
Yeah, in his heart,

318
00:10:51,260 --> 00:10:52,880
还以为自己做的是正确的事情
he was probably trying to do the right thing.

319
00:10:54,141 --> 00:10:55,760
经过密立根图书馆
And past the Millikan Library,

320
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:57,360
你会看到安耐克斯桥
You'll find the Bridge Annex,

321
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:59,540
正是在这个地方
which is also the same site

322
00:10:59,540 --> 00:11:01,880
卡尔·D·安德森发现了...
That Carl D. Anderson discovered the...?

323
00:11:01,880 --> 00:11:02,240
中子
Neutron.

324
00:11:02,980 --> 00:11:03,500
其他人呢
Anyone else?

325
00:11:03,500 --> 00:11:05,082
-正电子 -正电子
- Positron. - Positron.

326
00:11:05,220 --> 00:11:05,900
正确
That's right.

327
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:07,800
1932年
In 1932...

328
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:08,680
8月2日
On August 2nd...

329
00:11:08,680 --> 00:11:09,320
在3楼
On the third floor.

330
00:11:09,640 --> 00:11:10,180
真的吗
Really?

331
00:11:10,552 --> 00:11:12,410
我 我也不知道 我就是想赢过你
I-I don't know. Maybe I just wanted to win.

332
00:11:14,640 --> 00:11:15,580
我叫詹森
I'm Jason.

333
00:11:16,140 --> 00:11:16,500
我叫艾丽克斯
Alex.

334
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:19,040
这里是你的第一志愿吗
Is this your first-choice school?

335
00:11:19,131 --> 00:11:20,888
不 其实我想去麻省理工
No, I'm thinking M.I.T..

336
00:11:20,900 --> 00:11:21,440
真巧了
That's weird.

337
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:23,200
我家离那儿只有半小时
I live just half an hour from there.

338
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:24,800
这就是你想来这里的原因吧
Which explains why you want to go here.

339
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:27,600
我住在这儿 可是我想去东岸
I live here, and I want to go somewhere on the east coast.

340
00:11:27,760 --> 00:11:29,720
真的 我倒想要离家近一点
Really? I'd love to be close to home.

341
00:11:30,340 --> 00:11:31,980
周日一家人共进晚餐 不用自己洗衣服
Sunday dinners, laundry,

342
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:33,260
还能看着我弟弟 不让他毁了我的
make sure my brother doesn't mess with

343
00:11:33,260 --> 00:11:34,960
手工上色的南北战争模型
my hand-painted civil war miniatures...

344
00:11:36,060 --> 00:11:37,380
其实我并没有非常爱惜啦
which I don't cherish.

345
00:11:38,397 --> 00:11:40,420
那你为什么不去麻省理工
So why not M.I.T.?

346
00:11:40,420 --> 00:11:42,460
对于应用物理来说 这里的课程比较好
Well, for applied physics, this is the better program,

347
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:44,760
而且我不会根据离父母远还是近
and I'm not gonna make the biggest decision of my life

348
00:11:44,760 --> 00:11:45,980
来做自己人生最重要的选择
based off where my parents live.

349
00:11:48,020 --> 00:11:48,900
挺好的
Okay, then.

350
00:11:49,834 --> 00:11:51,340
不好意思 我说的是不是太武断了
Sorry. Did that... sound judgey?

351
00:11:51,340 --> 00:11:54,000
和漂亮的女孩子在一起我就不会说话
I'm not really good at talking to pretty girls.

352
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,925
我 我觉得我有点自闭症
I -- well, I have a touch of Asperger's.

353
00:11:56,380 --> 00:11:57,020
其实我没有
No, I don't.

354
00:11:57,140 --> 00:11:58,800
我这么说只是想吸引你的注意力
I just said that so you'd think I was interesting.

355
00:11:58,800 --> 00:12:02,987
我只是 有点希望你能来这儿
I was... just sorta hoping you'd be going here.

356
00:12:03,060 --> 00:12:03,500
真的吗
Really?

357
00:12:03,500 --> 00:12:04,840
你是我妈派来的吧
Did my mother put you up to this?

358
00:12:05,020 --> 00:12:07,040
你妈会派男孩子来和你调情吗
Does your mom tell boys to flirt with you?

359
00:12:07,051 --> 00:12:09,782
你 你是在和我调情啊
Oh. You're -- you're -- you're flirting with me.

360
00:12:09,816 --> 00:12:11,720
其实我一点都不惊讶
I mean, I don't mean to sound so surprised.

361
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:13,120
很多男孩子都会跟我调情
A lot of boys flirt with me.

362
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:14,320
没有很多 有一些
Not a lot. Some.

363
00:12:14,500 --> 00:12:16,380
的确有一个有自闭症的
Actually, one of them has Asperger's.

364
00:12:16,760 --> 00:12:19,120
他能告诉你你出生那天的天气
He could tell you the weather on the day you were born.

365
00:12:19,460 --> 00:12:21,240
好吧 我不知道自己为什么要说这个
Okay. Well, I don't know why I said that.

366
00:12:21,280 --> 00:12:26,000
关键是 我是单身 是我自己的选择
The point is, I am single, by my own choosing, so...

367
00:12:26,525 --> 00:12:26,970
天啊
Oh, my god!

368
00:12:26,970 --> 00:12:28,545
我没事 我没事 什么事都没有
I am fine! I'm fine! Everything's fine!

369
00:12:32,220 --> 00:12:33,760
我必须按它
I have to push it.

370
00:12:33,860 --> 00:12:35,040
我脑子里只想着要去按它
It's all I can think of.

371
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:37,060
让他按吧 管他呢
Just let him push it. Who cares?

372
00:12:37,160 --> 00:12:38,960
谁都不许碰这个按钮
No one is touching this button!

373
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:39,980
你不明白吗
Don't you see?

374
00:12:40,340 --> 00:12:42,000
这是一个性格测试
This is a test of character --

375
00:12:42,029 --> 00:12:44,160
测试我们是有自控能力的那类人
to see if we're the kind of people with self-control

376
00:12:44,160 --> 00:12:45,920
还是那种看到面前有芝士
or the kind who just grab at any piece of cheese

377
00:12:45,920 --> 00:12:46,940
就会拿起来吃的人
that's put in front of them.

378
00:12:47,380 --> 00:12:48,800
你难道就不想知道它能做什么吗
Don't you want to know what it does?

379
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:50,480
想知道它能做什么
"Want to know what it does"?

380
00:12:50,900 --> 00:12:52,600
当然 我超级想
Of course I do. It's killing me.

381
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:53,380
但我更希望的是
But what I want more

382
00:12:53,380 --> 00:12:54,880
你能遵守规则
is for you to learn to follow the rules.

383
00:12:55,266 --> 00:12:57,720
你是不是又在说我逃课的事
Is this about me skipping class again?

384
00:12:57,720 --> 00:12:59,840
你这么执着这事真的太奇怪了
It's weird how obsessed you are with that.

385
00:13:00,300 --> 00:13:01,380
让我按按钮
Now let me push that button!

386
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:01,840
不行
No!

387
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:03,400
如果你连这个简单的测试都过不了
If you can't even pass a simple test,

388
00:13:03,400 --> 00:13:05,320
怎么能进好大学
how are you ever gonna get in to a good college?

389
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:07,500
或者保住工作 我们只有一个地下室
Or hold down a job? We only have one basement.

390
00:13:07,500 --> 00:13:08,360
等你的人生也降到谷底时
There's no place for you to move

391
00:13:08,360 --> 00:13:09,340
你可就没地方去了
when your life bottoms out!

392
00:13:09,740 --> 00:13:10,100
好伤人
Okay.

393
00:13:11,580 --> 00:13:13,000
爸 我翘了那课
Dad, I cut that class

394
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:14,960
是因为我必须为我的电影拍最后一组镜头
because I had to get one last shot for my movie.

395
00:13:15,041 --> 00:13:17,032
换你也会逃课的
You would've done the same thing.

396
00:13:18,780 --> 00:13:20,160
我的天
Oh, my god!

397
00:13:20,820 --> 00:13:22,380
你气的不是我
You're not mad at me.

398
00:13:22,940 --> 00:13:26,280
你在气你自己 因为我跟你当年一样
You're mad at yourself because I'm just like you.

399
00:13:28,520 --> 00:13:29,580
歪打正着
Total shot in the dark.

400
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:32,880
你说得对 我给你树了个坏榜样
You're right -- I set a terrible example for you.

401
00:13:33,180 --> 00:13:35,000
没这回事 这榜样很好
No! It was awesome!

402
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:37,940
你以为史蒂夫·乔布斯有循规蹈矩吗
Do you think Steve Jobs followed every rule?

403
00:13:37,940 --> 00:13:38,860
还有魔术大师道格·汉宁
Doug Henning?

404
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:39,580
说下去
Keep talking.

405
00:13:40,180 --> 00:13:42,080
还有那个住在
What about that guy who lived in that town

406
00:13:42,080 --> 00:13:43,540
不让人跳舞的镇里的人
where people weren't allowed to dance?

407
00:13:43,552 --> 00:13:45,520
《浑身是劲》的主人公有遵规守纪吗
Did Footloose follow the rules?

408
00:13:45,520 --> 00:13:47,520
他叫伦 完全不守规矩
His name was Ren, and he most certainly did not.

409
00:13:47,620 --> 00:13:49,860
也许科学家找的就是这种人
Maybe that's what those scientists are looking for --

410
00:13:50,180 --> 00:13:50,480
不墨守成规的人
Rebels!

411
00:13:51,020 --> 00:13:51,640
知道么
You know what?

412
00:13:52,260 --> 00:13:54,960
我才不管那些禽兽要找什么样的人
Who gives a hoot what those bastards want?

413
00:13:54,980 --> 00:13:55,500
无意冒犯
No offense.

414
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:58,520
我们就要违反规则 就要按按钮
We're gonna break every rule, and we're pushing that button!

415
00:13:58,780 --> 00:13:59,180
就是这样
Yeah!

416
00:13:59,520 --> 00:14:00,560
离按钮远点
Back away from the button!

417
00:14:01,140 --> 00:14:01,860
你这是干什么
What are you doing?

418
00:14:02,040 --> 00:14:03,700
我这一生都在违反规定
I've been breaking the rules my entire life,

419
00:14:03,700 --> 00:14:04,600
看看我落得什么下场
and look where it's gotten me.

420
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:05,820
住在爸妈家的地下室里
I live in my parents' basement!

421
00:14:05,820 --> 00:14:07,940
我已经恨透了自己总是一事无成
I'm sick of being a failure at everything!

422
00:14:08,920 --> 00:14:10,260
我的天
Oh, my god!

423
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:11,840
你气的不是我们
You're not mad at us.

424
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:13,080
你是气你自己
You're mad at yourself.

425
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:14,180
我就是这意思
That's what I'm saying!

426
00:14:16,620 --> 00:14:17,680
你去哪了
Where were you?

427
00:14:18,060 --> 00:14:18,720
安慰杰
Consoling Jay.

428
00:14:19,200 --> 00:14:21,260
你砸碎的不只是那只兔子 女士
That bunny wasn't the only thing you shattered, lady.

429
00:14:21,420 --> 00:14:22,720
你第一次跟杰约会的时候
When you first started dating him,

430
00:14:22,780 --> 00:14:23,900
他给你取了什么昵称
what was his nickname for you?

431
00:14:24,260 --> 00:14:25,200
性感裤裤
Sexy pants.

432
00:14:25,940 --> 00:14:26,700
另外一个
The other one.

433
00:14:26,700 --> 00:14:27,698
兔兔
Bunny.

434
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:32,960
所以他才把手链放到兔子里
Oh, so that's why he put the bracelet inside the bunny.

435
00:14:33,360 --> 00:14:34,760
里面没有手链
There was no bracelet.

436
00:14:35,080 --> 00:14:36,700
兔子就是礼物
The bunny was the present.

437
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:37,740
就这只吗
That?

438
00:14:37,740 --> 00:14:39,200
他亲手做了送你的
He made it for you himself.

439
00:14:39,360 --> 00:14:39,820
不是吧
No.

440
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:42,000
他在陶艺课上做的 上了好几周课呢
In a pottery class he's been taking for weeks.

441
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:42,840
不会吧
No!

442
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:44,180
结果你把它砸碎在台子上
And you smashed it on the counter.

443
00:14:44,180 --> 00:14:45,780
他尴尬得都不敢告诉你实情
And he was too embarrassed to say anything.

444
00:14:46,500 --> 00:14:46,980
不是吧
No!

445
00:14:47,580 --> 00:14:49,060
不能这样
I can't take it!

446
00:14:49,380 --> 00:14:50,820
胶水 快拿胶水来
Glue! Okay, give me glue!

447
00:14:50,920 --> 00:14:51,640
我要胶水
I need glue!

448
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:55,420
快让我停下来
Make it stop!

449
00:14:58,860 --> 00:15:00,240
海莉 把凳子放下
Haley, put down the chair.

450
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:00,920
为什么
Why should I?!

451
00:15:00,920 --> 00:15:02,480
因为这越来越荒唐了
Because this is getting absurd,

452
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:03,920
被整屋科学家
and it's no fun being laughed at

453
00:15:03,920 --> 00:15:06,200
和穿尿布的猴子嘲笑一点也不好玩
by a room full of scientists and a monkey in a diaper.

454
00:15:06,200 --> 00:15:07,700
没错 我们必须按下按钮
Yeah! We need to push that button,

455
00:15:07,800 --> 00:15:09,440
告诉那些臭学究我们不是胆小鬼
show those eggheads that we're not sheep!

456
00:15:09,680 --> 00:15:12,120
不行 违反规定并不代表你是英雄
No! Breaking the rules doesn't make you a hero!

457
00:15:12,280 --> 00:15:13,340
而是个傻瓜
It makes you a screw-up!

458
00:15:13,660 --> 00:15:14,560
记住我说的 卢克
Take it from me, Luke --

459
00:15:14,800 --> 00:15:16,180
一百万个退学学生里
One out of a million dropouts

460
00:15:16,180 --> 00:15:17,500
才出一个史蒂夫·乔布斯
becomes Steve Jobs.

461
00:15:17,500 --> 00:15:19,760
知道有多少人变成没工作的败类吗
Do you know who become losers with no jobs?

462
00:15:19,980 --> 00:15:21,320
剩下的九万九千人
The other 99,000!

463
00:15:22,180 --> 00:15:24,180
宝贝 你不是败类
Honey, you are not a loser.

464
00:15:24,620 --> 00:15:25,380
得了吧
Oh, please.

465
00:15:25,900 --> 00:15:27,780
你们对我的"期望"我都听到了
I hear the shots you all take at me.

466
00:15:27,780 --> 00:15:30,218
我妹妹就要跟我读同一个年级了
I see my sister about to lap me

467
00:15:30,218 --> 00:15:32,600
进的学校还是我做梦都进不了的
at a college that I would never be able to get into.

468
00:15:32,600 --> 00:15:34,600
就连蠢成我这样的都知道
Even someone as dumb as me

469
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:36,980
我是个多没出息的人
can see that I'm a giant failure!

470
00:15:36,980 --> 00:15:39,143
海莉 别说了 好吗
Haley, stop, okay?

471
00:15:39,780 --> 00:15:40,980
海莉 我告诉你
Haley, let me tell you something --

472
00:15:40,980 --> 00:15:44,060
你有自己的价值 能力和潜力
You have value, talent, and potential

473
00:15:44,060 --> 00:15:45,180
是他们的测试衡量不出来的
that their tests can't measure.

474
00:15:46,100 --> 00:15:47,760
没人在意你是否符合他们的要求
Who cares if you don't fit into their little box.

475
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:48,620
你在寻找适合自己的路
You're finding your way.

476
00:15:48,620 --> 00:15:50,420
二十几岁的年纪就应该这样
That's what your 20s are for --

477
00:15:50,560 --> 00:15:51,640
去尝试
to take chances...

478
00:15:51,650 --> 00:15:54,520
去犯错 吃一堑长一智
to -- to make mistakes and to learn from them,

479
00:15:54,520 --> 00:15:56,040
而你已经在吸取教训了
and you are learning from them.

480
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:58,860
你不按按钮就证明了这一点
The fact that you won't push this button proves that.

481
00:16:00,180 --> 00:16:01,780
说得太暖心了 爸
That was really sweet, dad.

482
00:16:02,545 --> 00:16:04,100
我居然还想
I can't believe I was gonna hit you

483
00:16:04,100 --> 00:16:05,320
抡凳子砸你
over the head with that chair.

484
00:16:05,980 --> 00:16:08,040
等等 所以我们不按按钮了吗
Wait. So now we're not pushing the button?

485
00:16:08,180 --> 00:16:09,660
不按了 我们要支持海莉
No. We're supporting Haley.

486
00:16:09,920 --> 00:16:11,140
你下半辈子都要支持[养着]她了
For the rest of your life.

487
00:16:11,200 --> 00:16:12,420
说这话帮不上忙
That is not helpful.

488
00:16:13,440 --> 00:16:14,760
我们要团结一心
We need to stick together.

489
00:16:15,260 --> 00:16:16,000
我懂了
Oh, my god.

490
00:16:16,180 --> 00:16:17,040
我懂了
Oh, my god.

491
00:16:17,100 --> 00:16:18,560
测试的目的原来是这个
That's what this test is.

492
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:21,320
它不在于到底
It's not about whether we push the button

493
00:16:21,320 --> 00:16:22,580
按不按按钮
or don't push the button.

494
00:16:22,940 --> 00:16:26,640
你们是想看我们是为此团结还是分裂
You want to find out if this unites us or divides us.

495
00:16:28,460 --> 00:16:30,040
大家牵着手
Let's join hands

496
00:16:30,040 --> 00:16:32,600
给这些狗娘养的
and send these sons of bitches

497
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:35,220
和臭猴子开开眼
and their filthy monkey a message!

498
00:16:44,200 --> 00:16:45,242
感觉好好
Feels good.

499
00:16:46,680 --> 00:16:47,180
等等
Wait a minute.

500
00:16:47,460 --> 00:16:49,040
我们什么也不做的话他们怎么知道
How are they gonna know we're sending them a message

501
00:16:49,040 --> 00:16:50,180
我们要他们好看
if we're not doing anything?

502
00:16:50,740 --> 00:16:51,420
有道理
That's true.

503
00:16:52,140 --> 00:16:53,700
我们必须按按钮
We have to hit that button.

504
00:16:53,700 --> 00:16:55,240
完全尼玛的正确
Damn straight.

505
00:16:55,708 --> 00:16:56,624
好嘞
Yeah.

506
00:17:05,920 --> 00:17:06,820
谁开的
Who did that?

507
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:07,640
是我们
We did...

508
00:17:08,040 --> 00:17:08,880
以一家人的名义
as a family.

509
00:17:09,320 --> 00:17:10,560
你们没看到标志吗
Did you not see the sign?

510
00:17:10,780 --> 00:17:13,280
现在空调关不掉了 我们还得叫人来
Now the A.C. won't shut off. We have to call a guy.

511
00:17:13,380 --> 00:17:15,560
不好意思 这个...
Oh, I'm sorry. Is this...

512
00:17:15,560 --> 00:17:16,436
如果...
What if, uh...

513
00:17:17,820 --> 00:17:19,420
对 这满楼的科学家
Yeah, building full of scientists

514
00:17:19,420 --> 00:17:21,260
没有一个想到按两下按钮试试
and no one thought to push the button twice.

515
00:17:21,399 --> 00:17:23,463
请使用二号铅笔
Please use number 2 pencils.

516
00:17:29,486 --> 00:17:30,737
后面是墙
Yeah, just wall.

517
00:17:30,860 --> 00:17:32,240
这才是测试
So this is the...test.

518
00:17:33,240 --> 00:17:35,100
我跟珠宝商说清楚了
I got that cleared up with the jeweler.

519
00:17:35,300 --> 00:17:36,380
他尴尬死了
Boy, was he embarrassed.

520
00:17:37,340 --> 00:17:37,900
这是什么
What's that?

521
00:17:38,660 --> 00:17:39,200
是我的兔兔吗
Is that my bunny?

522
00:17:39,360 --> 00:17:41,240
不 我是你的兔兔
No. I am your bunny.

523
00:17:41,340 --> 00:17:43,928
杰 我不想要那只手链了
Jay, I don't want that bracelet anymore.

524
00:17:43,940 --> 00:17:46,920
这是你送给我的最好的礼物
This is the most amazing gift you have ever given me.

525
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:48,620
真的吗 你喜欢吗
Really? You--you--you like it?

526
00:17:48,620 --> 00:17:50,280
我爱死它了
I love it.

527
00:17:50,280 --> 00:17:51,400
把它黏回去的过程中
And putting it back together

528
00:17:51,400 --> 00:17:53,920
我意识到你为此倾注了多少心血
made me realize how much work you put into it.

529
00:17:53,930 --> 00:17:56,720
说实话 全都在于细节
Well, it--it's all in the details, really.

530
00:17:56,720 --> 00:17:57,940
兔子就在粘土之中
The bunny was in the clay.

531
00:17:58,280 --> 00:17:59,640
我只需要把它摸索出来
I just had to find it.

532
00:17:59,740 --> 00:18:01,240
现在看看我给你的礼物
Now I'm going to give you yours.

533
00:18:01,300 --> 00:18:03,360
也是时候了
I think it's about that time.

534
00:18:04,020 --> 00:18:06,300
这个是...
And this would be, um...

535
00:18:06,300 --> 00:18:08,920
电影票制成的书签
A bookmark made of movie tickets

536
00:18:08,920 --> 00:18:11,820
用的是我们看的第一场电影的票
from the first movie we ever saw together.

537
00:18:11,820 --> 00:18:13,361
我很喜欢
I-I-I love it.

538
00:18:13,460 --> 00:18:15,880
这是那种我从来不会给自己买的东西
It's the kind of thing I'd never get for myself.

539
00:18:16,380 --> 00:18:16,860
从来不会
Ever.

540
00:18:17,240 --> 00:18:19,580
我们应该一直互相送这种礼物
This is what we should always do for each other--

541
00:18:21,728 --> 00:18:24,092
我们过于追求物质上的东西了
We get too caught up in--in material possessions.

542
00:18:24,092 --> 00:18:25,540
我们拥有的东西太多了
Ah, we got too much stuff.

543
00:18:25,540 --> 00:18:26,940
明天一早就把它退了
Return this first thing tomorrow.

544
00:18:27,020 --> 00:18:29,360
我也要把我给你买的表退了
Yeah, and I'm gonna return the watch that I bought you.

545
00:18:29,660 --> 00:18:30,460
晚饭好了
Dinner's ready!

546
00:18:32,440 --> 00:18:35,560
那是我想要的那条玫瑰金色手链吗
So, is that the rose gold bracelet that I wanted?

547
00:18:35,620 --> 00:18:36,600
真是件极好的珠宝
Dynamite piece of jewelry.

548
00:18:36,740 --> 00:18:37,720
说起那表
And that watch--

549
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:41,140
是陶制的 有十天后备电源的那款吗
Is that the ceramic with the 10-day, uh, power reserve?

550
00:18:41,140 --> 00:18:43,300
当然 那表看上去真性感
Of course. It's so sexy, that watch.

551
00:18:43,311 --> 00:18:44,260
是啊 那种喷砂面
Yeah, the matte finish

552
00:18:44,260 --> 00:18:46,420
不会像这只表一样反光让人看不清
doesn't always catch the sun and blind you like this one.

553
00:18:46,420 --> 00:18:49,783
真巧 我倒喜欢手腕上戴着闪光的东西
It's so interesting, 'cause I love shiny things on my wrist.

554
00:18:49,953 --> 00:18:53,077
看在老天的份上 收下礼物吧
Oh, for God sakes, just keep the stupid gifts.

555
00:18:56,380 --> 00:18:56,860
喂
Hello?

556
00:18:57,560 --> 00:18:58,700
是我
Hey, it's me.

557
00:18:58,920 --> 00:19:00,840
我觉得我和小卡犯了个大错
I think Cam and I made a huge mistake.

558
00:19:01,160 --> 00:19:02,780
我理解 恋爱虽易 婚姻不易
Oh, I get it. Marriage is tough.

559
00:19:02,880 --> 00:19:03,760
深呼一口气
Just take a deep breath

560
00:19:03,760 --> 00:19:05,340
到杂货店找个人调下情就好了
and go flirt with somebody at the grocery store.

561
00:19:05,500 --> 00:19:06,660
不 是莉莉的事
No, about Lily.

562
00:19:06,940 --> 00:19:08,740
我们想拍张新的全家福
We're trying to take this new family picture,

563
00:19:08,740 --> 00:19:11,640
可她一直笑得很诡异
and she's doing this weird smile thing...

564
00:19:11,920 --> 00:19:13,040
你们说什么了吗
And you said something?

565
00:19:13,040 --> 00:19:16,549
假设 假设是小卡说的
Uh, well, let's--let's just say Cam did.

566
00:19:16,560 --> 00:19:18,600
首先 每个小孩都会这样
First of all, all kids go through this.

567
00:19:18,800 --> 00:19:19,900
该让你看看卢克三年级时
You should see every picture

568
00:19:19,900 --> 00:19:21,060
他每张照片的样子
we have of Luke from third grade.

569
00:19:21,180 --> 00:19:23,180
他看上去好像在打喷嚏 实在太可惜了
He looks like he's mid-sneeze, which is a shame,

570
00:19:23,423 --> 00:19:25,100
因为那年我胸大很上镜
'cause I was having a great boob year.

571
00:19:25,100 --> 00:19:25,800
你采取的什么措施
What did you do?

572
00:19:26,120 --> 00:19:28,620
可能是因为当时吃的避孕药 但...
I think it might've been the birth control I was taking, but...

573
00:19:28,620 --> 00:19:29,680
不 我是指卢克
No, come on. About Luke!

574
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:31,940
什么都没做 我们没采取任何措施
Oh! Nothing. We didn't do anything.

575
00:19:32,300 --> 00:19:34,440
米奇尔 我要饱含爱意地告诉你
Mitchell, I say this with love,

576
00:19:34,460 --> 00:19:35,580
早在你要做家长的时候
but when you became a parent,

577
00:19:35,580 --> 00:19:37,513
我就知道这可能会成问题
I knew this was gonna be a problem for you

578
00:19:37,513 --> 00:19:39,040
因为你爱掌控一切
'cause you like to control everything.

579
00:19:39,040 --> 00:19:40,680
天啊 这句话要是不含爱意会是什么样
Good lord. What would that sound like without love?

580
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:43,060
总而言之 船到桥头自然直
Bottom line-- it's all gonna work itself out.

581
00:19:43,060 --> 00:19:44,020
可如果你给她施压
But if you push her on it,

582
00:19:44,020 --> 00:19:45,750
她与你也就渐行渐远
she's just gonna push you away.

583
00:19:46,360 --> 00:19:47,300
天啊
Oh, my God.

584
00:19:48,760 --> 00:19:50,220
感谢大家的到来
Thanks for coming, everybody.

585
00:19:50,420 --> 00:19:52,440
正如你们所知 我们的录取率是8%
As you know, our acceptance rate is 8%,

586
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:55,880
在秋季我见到的每个人战胜了其他...
so in the fall, I look forward to seeing one out of...

587
00:19:58,200 --> 00:19:59,260
必然不会有他
So...not him.

588
00:20:05,179 --> 00:20:07,016
看来该道别了 要去麻省理工的人
Well, I guess this is it, M.I.T.

589
00:20:07,622 --> 00:20:09,520
如果你到波士顿玩 记得找我...
Uh, when you visit Boston, look me up...

590
00:20:09,520 --> 00:20:09,920
达令[亲爱的]
Darling.

591
00:20:09,920 --> 00:20:11,580
好吧 甜心
Okay, sweetie.

592
00:20:11,612 --> 00:20:14,830
那是我的姓 我叫詹森·达令
Uh, t-that's my last name-- Jason Darling.

593
00:20:14,830 --> 00:20:17,160
原来如此 我叫艾丽克斯·邓菲
Oh, well, Alex Dunphy--

594
00:20:17,160 --> 00:20:18,068
邓超的"邓"不是凳子的"凳"
"P-h" not "F",

595
00:20:18,068 --> 00:20:19,169
王菲的"菲"不是"非诚勿扰"的"非"
"Y" not "E-e".

596
00:20:19,169 --> 00:20:20,420
右耳旁一个"又" 草字头下...
"D-u-n-p-h"...

597
00:20:20,420 --> 00:20:21,500
我话咋这么多
Why am I still talking?

598
00:20:25,700 --> 00:20:26,500
好吧
All right.

599
00:20:29,180 --> 00:20:29,780
再见
Bye.

600
00:20:31,700 --> 00:20:32,600
原来你在这
There you are.

601
00:20:33,640 --> 00:20:37,580
宝贝 很抱歉我之前一直逼你
Listen, honey, I am so sorry about pushing so hard earlier.

602
00:20:37,580 --> 00:20:40,340
如果要问有谁能做出明智的
If anyone is able to make a smart decision

603
00:20:40,340 --> 00:20:41,800
择校决定 那就是你了
about where to go to school, it's you.

604
00:20:42,400 --> 00:20:44,300
哪怕那所学校远在
Even if that school is all the way

605
00:20:44,300 --> 00:20:45,400
美国的另一头
on the other side of the country.

606
00:20:46,140 --> 00:20:48,460
其实 这里有很多不错的地方
Actually, there's a lot to like here.

607
00:20:48,820 --> 00:20:49,380
真的吗
Really?!

608
00:20:51,260 --> 00:20:52,220
好极了
That's cool.

609
00:20:52,700 --> 00:20:53,200
无所谓啦
Whatever.

610
00:20:54,860 --> 00:20:56,880
我猜家里有这么一个人
I guess there's somebody around here

611
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:58,800
让她舍不得离开
she's not ready to say goodbye to.

612
00:20:59,880 --> 00:21:00,880
他加我好友了
He friended me!

613
00:21:04,040 --> 00:21:06,560
来吧 我们要给你看个东西
Okay, come on, we have something to show you.

614
00:21:06,560 --> 00:21:09,080
是晚饭吗 还是说我的嘴太丑不能吃饭
Is it dinner, or is my mouth too ugly to put food in?

615
00:21:09,120 --> 00:21:09,800
不是
Okay, no.

616
00:21:09,800 --> 00:21:11,800
另外不要再这么说自己了
And please don't say things like that about yourself.

617
00:21:12,060 --> 00:21:12,760
你们选了一张吗
You picked one?

618
00:21:12,820 --> 00:21:13,560
当然了
We sure did,

619
00:21:13,560 --> 00:21:15,860
很抱歉我们让你不开心了
and we're sorry we made you feel bad.

620
00:21:15,880 --> 00:21:17,380
我们只是不习惯你的新笑容
We just weren't used to your new smile,

621
00:21:17,380 --> 00:21:18,680
可现在我们爱死它啦
But now we are, and we love it!

622
00:21:18,800 --> 00:21:21,280
是啊 照片美极了 你也美极了
Yes, it's beautiful, and you're beautiful,

623
00:21:21,280 --> 00:21:23,160
我们不想改变[换掉]你身上的任何东西
and we don't want to change a single thing about you.

624
00:21:23,170 --> 00:21:24,689
内裤除外
Except maybe your underpants.

625
00:21:27,260 --> 00:21:28,680
这笑声是什么情况
Okay, where did that laugh come from?

626
00:21:28,680 --> 00:21:29,780
不知道 但必须让她改
I don't know, but it's gotta go.
